* White or very light background
* Rectangular concept boxes
* Thin coloured strokes
* Separate coloured header inside every box
* White body containing a short definition
* Straight or orthogonal relationship lines
* Arrowheads showing relationship direction
* Relationship verbs and cardinalities displayed on the lines
* No icons, gradients, shadows or decorative graphics
* Use consistent spacing and alignment
